                                        "entry_id": "d7561b61-4d95-3f5b-8d34-8fadcb6d0eaf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An aromatic hydrocarbon of formula C₆H₆ whose structure consists of a ring of alternate single and double bonds."
